WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:16.066
When Pinocchio woke up the next morning, the rain had stopped.

2
00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:19.132
He jumped out of bed, hoping to see Geppetto.

3
00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:21.462
But he saw only the Blue Fairy.

4
00:00:21.463 --> 00:00:24.979
"Do you want to become a real boy?" she asked.

5
00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:28.374
"Yes!" said Pinocchio excitedly.

6
00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:31.903
"Do you want to save Geppetto?" she asked.

7
00:00:31.904 --> 00:00:34.719
"Oh yes!" said Pinocchio.

8
00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.043
"Then listen carefully.

9
00:00:37.044 --> 00:00:41.542
To become a real boy, you must obey your father.

10
00:00:41.543 --> 00:00:44.469
But first, you must save him.

11
00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:47.628
You will save him by honoring him."

12
00:00:47.629 --> 00:00:49.695
"I don't understand.

13
00:00:49.696 --> 00:00:54.850
How can I honor him if he is not here?" Pinocchio asked, confused.

14
00:00:54.851 --> 00:00:57.504
"You must honor his wishes.

15
00:00:57.505 --> 00:01:01.844
What did Geppetto want you to do?" asked the Blue Fairy.

16
00:01:01.845 --> 00:01:05.421
"He wanted me to go to school," he said.

17
00:01:05.422 --> 00:01:07.859
"Then you must go to school.

18
00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:11.691
You may live with me and study in the village.

19
00:01:11.692 --> 00:01:16.500
Once you honor him, you can save him," she said.

20
00:01:16.501 --> 00:01:20.121
Pinocchio was sad to hear this.

21
00:01:20.122 --> 00:01:22.340
He did not want to go to school.

22
00:01:22.341 --> 00:01:28.729
But, he wanted to save his father so he agreed to go.

23
00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:31.882
Pinocchio became the best student in the school.

24
00:01:31.883 --> 00:01:34.388
His teacher was very happy with him.

25
00:01:34.389 --> 00:01:38.600
However, some of the students were mean to Pinocchio.

26
00:01:38.601 --> 00:01:42.495
One day after school, some of the boys followed him home.

27
00:01:42.496 --> 00:01:46.901
"How can a wooden head become smart?" one boy asked.

28
00:01:46.902 --> 00:01:50.060
"Use it as a bookend!" the other said.

29
00:01:50.061 --> 00:01:52.743
All the boys laughed.

30
00:01:52.744 --> 00:01:58.102
"What will Pinocchio be when he grows up?" the first boy asked the others.

31
00:01:58.103 --> 00:02:02.027
"A little wooden boy!" they answered.

32
00:02:02.028 --> 00:02:04.230
And they laughed again.

33
00:02:04.231 --> 00:02:10.090
"I'm smart, and one day, I will be a real boy!" said Pinocchio.

34
00:02:10.091 --> 00:02:17.990
"Oh yeah? Well, if you prove you are smart now, you can be a real boy today," one boy said.

35
00:02:17.991 --> 00:02:21.404
"What do you mean?" asked Pinocchio.

36
00:02:21.405 --> 00:02:29.031
"Well, if you do what real boys do, that would make you a real boy, right?" he asked.

37
00:02:29.032 --> 00:02:33.509
"Well, I guess so," said Pinocchio.

38
00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:40.437
"And if I were a real boy, then I could save Father faster," he thought to himself.

39
00:02:40.438 --> 00:02:44.478
"I can do anything you can do!" said Pinocchio.

40
00:02:44.479 --> 00:02:47.872
"I'll show you I can be a real boy."

41
00:02:47.873 --> 00:02:52.124
"Oh yeah? Well, today, we are running away to Paradisle.

42
00:02:52.125 --> 00:02:56.555
If you're a real boy, you'll come with us," one boy said.

43
00:02:56.556 --> 00:03:00.776
"What is Paradisle?" Pinocchio asked.

44
00:03:00.777 --> 00:03:04.563
"It's an island where real boys play all day.

45
00:03:04.564 --> 00:03:06.481
They never have to do work.

46
00:03:06.482 --> 00:03:08.777
They eat dessert for every meal.

47
00:03:08.778 --> 00:03:11.936
And everyone is rich."

48
00:03:11.937 --> 00:03:13.906
This sounded great to Pinocchio.

49
00:03:13.907 --> 00:03:16.710
So he followed the boys to the end of the village.

50
00:03:16.711 --> 00:03:19.957
There, they met a man with a wagon full of boys.

51
00:03:19.958 --> 00:03:23.695
The wagon was pulled by very sad donkeys wearing clothes.

52
00:03:23.696 --> 00:03:25.940
But the boys didn't notice them.

53
00:03:25.941 --> 00:03:31.975
They jumped into the wagon and rode to the end of the island.

54
00:03:31.976 --> 00:03:35.904
"Here we are, boys!" called the wagon master.

55
00:03:35.905 --> 00:03:43.021
"This ferry goes to Paradisle, where every day is a holiday, and you never have to work.

56
00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:47.253
Come quickly, before the ferry is full!"

57
00:03:47.254 --> 00:03:50.180
Pinocchio and the boys ran to the ferry.

58
00:03:50.181 --> 00:03:54.106
Pinocchio noticed there were a lot of donkeys coming off the ferry.

59
00:03:54.107 --> 00:03:56.576
But he didn't stop to wonder why.

60
00:03:56.577 --> 00:03:58.619
He wanted to be a real boy.

61
00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:00.892
And he wanted to save his father.

62
00:04:00.893 --> 00:04:08.590
At Paradisle, he could do both and he wouldn't have to work!
